    {
      "sentence_id": 9,
      "text": "This writ petition has been filed by the petitioners with a prayer for a direction to the opposite party no.1- Land Acquisition Officer and Competent Authority, Bhubaneswar for recalculation and disburse of the compensation to the petitioners as per the order dated 20.04.2022 by the learned Arbitrator passed in ARB Case No.95 of 2016 and No.96 of 2016 within a stipulated period.",
